    "/api/wallet/deduct": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "InternalWalletController_deduct",
        "summary": "扣费（契约 §4.1）",
        "description": "产品 → 门户。幂等键 bill_no：重复提交返回 code=3003，data 为首次结果（**视为成功**）。\n\n错误：3001 余额不足（`data.balance` 带当前余额，**不重试**）、3002 钱包冻结（不重试）、1001 参数错误。\n\n产品实现要点：账单先落库 → 调本接口 → code=0 改 status=1；网络超时/5xx 用**同一 bill_no** 退避重试（1s/5s/30s）。",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeductDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "内网计费 internal"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "internal-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/wallet/refund": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "InternalWalletController_refund",
        "summary": "退款（契约 §4.2）",
        "description": "产品 → 门户。幂等键 refund_bill_no。退款退回**原扣费账单所属的钱包**，调用方无需传 userId。\n\n错误：3005 原 bill_no 未入账、3004 累计退款超出原单可退余额（`data.refundable_cents` 给出剩余可退）。",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RefundDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "内网计费 internal"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "internal-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/shop/products": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "ShopController_products",
        "summary": "商品列表（契约 §2.1）· 公开，无需登录",
        "description": "返回 `{ list: [...] }`，不分页。只返回**在售**商品。**无需 token**。\n\n`spec` 是**产品自定义结构**，门户原样透传，前端要按 key 通用渲染，别假设一定有某个字段。\n\n`stock` 为 `null` 表示不限或产品未上报，**前端显示「现货」而不是「0 件」**。\n\n`billing_mode`：1 包周期（下单即扣）、2 按量（购买时 0 元，后付费由产品出账）。\n\n⚠️ 这里显示的是缓存价，**下单以后端重算为准**。\n\n⚠️ 按 IP 限流；超限返回 `1001` 且 `data.retry_after` 给出需等待秒数。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "product_code",
            "required": false,
            "in": "query",
            "description": "按产品代码过滤",
            "schema": {
              "example": "storage",
              "enum": [
                "storage",
                "phone",
                "desktop"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "商城 shop"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/shop/orders": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "ShopController_create",
        "summary": "创建订单（契约 §2.2）",
        "description": "1~10 项；`quantity` 默认 1、单项最多 10、**云手机（phone）最多 3**。\n\n**请求里不要传价格** —— 后端按当前 `p_product` 缓存价重算，传了也不认。\n\n错误：4003 商品不存在或已下架（让用户刷新列表）、4004 库存不足。\n\n创建时会校验库存，**支付时会再校验一次**。",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateOrderDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "商城 shop"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "get": {
        "operationId": "ShopController_listMine",
        "summary": "我的订单列表（契约外补充）",
        "description": "按创建时间倒序分页，返回结构与订单详情一致（含 items）。契约原文只有\"订单详情\"，此接口是为前端补齐的。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "required": false,
            "in": "query",
            "description": "页码，从 1 开始",
            "schema": {
              "default": 1,
              "example": 1,
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "size",
            "required": false,
            "in": "query",
            "description": "每页条数（上限 100）",
            "schema": {
              "default": 20,
              "example": 20,
              "type": "number"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "商城 shop"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/shop/orders/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "ShopController_detail",
        "summary": "订单详情（契约 §2.3）",
        "description": "订单 status：`0` 待支付 · `1` 部分成功 · `2` 全部成功 · `3` 全部失败。\n\n订单项 status：`0` 待支付 · `1` 已支付（**开通中**）· `2` 开通成功 · `3` 失败待退款 · `4` 已退款。\n\n成功项带 `instance_id` / `expire_at`；失败项带 `fail_reason`（如 `OUT_OF_STOCK`）。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "in": "path",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "商城 shop"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/shop/orders/{id}/pay": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "ShopController_pay",
        "summary": "支付订单（契约 §2.4）",
        "description": "**扣费同步完成、开通异步进行**（契约写的是同步循环，本实现把 provision 拆到后台，避免 30s 长请求打满连接池）。\n\n返回里：`accepted_items` = 本次受理项数；`processing_items` > 0 表示**还在开通中，前端应轮询订单详情**。\n\n已受理的项状态是 `1 已支付`，开通完成后会变成 `2 开通成功` 或 `4 已退款`（失败自动退款）。\n\n错误：3001 余额不足（**未处理的项保持 0，充值后可再次点支付**）、4001 订单不存在、4002 订单状态不允许（已全部失败的订单不可再支付）。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "in": "path",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "商城 shop"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/admin/reconciliation/daily": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "AdminReconciliationController_daily",
        "summary": "日对账结果（契约 §6）",
        "description": "不传 `date` 默认查前一日（UTC）。返回每产品的门户金额、产品金额、差异金额与三类差异笔数（仅产品侧有 / 仅门户侧有 / 金额不一致），`detail` 里带差异 `bill_no` 列表。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "date",
            "required": false,
            "in": "query",
            "description": "业务日 YYYY-MM-DD（UTC），缺省为前一日",
            "schema": {
              "example": "2026-10-08",
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "管理端 admin"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "admin-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/admin/reconciliation/run": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "AdminReconciliationController_run",
        "summary": "手动触发对账（补跑/排障）",
        "description": "对指定日期与产品重新比对并覆盖结果。**差异不会自动修复**，只落库供人工处理。\n\n正常情况每天 04:10（UTC）自动对前一日；这个接口用于漏跑补数或排查差异。",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunReconciliationDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "管理端 admin"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "admin-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/admin/reconciliation/provision-jobs": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "AdminReconciliationController_provisionJobs",
        "summary": "开通任务队列状态（排障）",
        "description": "返回各状态任务数：`0` 待处理、`1` 处理中、`2` 成功、`3` 失败。堆积过多说明产品侧开通异常。",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "管理端 admin"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "admin-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/internal/reconciliation/report": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "InternalReconciliationController_report",
        "summary": "产品账单上报（契约外补充，对账前置）",
        "description": "产品侧把当日账单推给门户，门户据此与自己的流水逐笔比对。\n\n幂等：以 `(biz_date, product_code, bill_no)` 唯一，重复上报覆盖金额。\n\n**`product_code` 以 `X-Internal-Key` 的归属为准**：传了必须一致（否则 1004），不传则按密钥推定。\n\n需要 `X-Internal-Key`。产品侧不推也可以：把账单导出成 CSV 走人工对账，但自动对账会缺数据。",
        "parameters": [],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReportBillsDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "契约 §0.2：业务响应统一 HTTP 200，结果看 body 的 code"
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "内网计费 internal"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "internal-key": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/healthz": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "AppController_health",
        "summary": "探活（运维）",
        "description": "供 nginx / 容器探活。`data.status`：ok=数据库可达；degraded=数据库不可达。无需鉴权。",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "运维 ops"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/meta": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "AppController_meta",
        "summary": "服务元信息（运维）",
        "description": "返回服务名、契约版本、JWT issuer 与 kid、各产品接入代码。**不含任何密钥**，供排障比对。",
        "parameters": [],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        "tags": [
          "运维 ops"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "info": {
    "title": "云平台统一门户 API（cloud-portal）",
    "description": "依据《云平台统一门户 API 契约 v1.0》（2026-09-30 定稿）实现。\n\n约定提醒：\n- 响应恒为 `{ code, message, data }`，HTTP 状态码基本为 200，**成功与否看 code**；\n- 金额一律整数「分」；时间一律 UTC ISO 8601；\n- 例外：`/.well-known/jwks.json` 返回标准 JWKS，`/api/admin/transactions/export` 返回 CSV，两者不套统一响应壳。",
    "version": "1.0",
    "contact": {}
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "认证 auth",
      "description": "契约 §1"
    },
    {
      "name": "钱包 wallet",
      "description": "契约 §3"
    },
    {
      "name": "内网计费 internal",
      "description": "契约 §4（产品 → 门户）"
    },
    {
      "name": "管理端 admin",
      "description": "契约 §6"
    },
    {
      "name": "商城 shop",
      "description": "契约 §2（round 3）"
    },
    {
      "name": "运维 ops",
      "description": "探活与元信息"
    }
  ],
  "servers": [],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearer": {
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT",
        "type": "http"
      },
      "internal-key": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Internal-Key"
      },
      "admin-key": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Admin-Key"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "RegisterDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "用户名：4-32 位，仅字母/数字/下划线",
            "example": "luobo",
            "minLength": 4,
            "maxLength": 32,
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_]+$"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "密码：8-64 位，且至少包含字母和数字",
            "example": "Ab12345678",
            "minLength": 8,
            "maxLength": 64
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "大陆手机号 11 位（可选）",
            "example": "13800000000"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "username",
          "password"
        ]
      },
      "LoginDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "username": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "**用户名或手机号**（同一个字段，后端自动识别）",
            "example": "luobo"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "密码",
            "example": "Ab12345678"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "username",
          "password"
        ]
      },
      "RechargeApplyDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "amount_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "充值金额，单位：分（100 ~ 10,000,000，即 ¥1 ~ ¥10万）",
            "example": 10000,
            "minimum": 100,
            "maximum": 10000000
          },
          "remark": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "转账备注 / 凭证说明（供管理员核销时核对）",
            "example": "微信转账，尾号1234"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "amount_cents"
        ]
      },
      "ConfirmRechargeDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "reject": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "true = 驳回；缺省或 false = 确认到账",
            "example": false,
            "default": false
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "驳回原因（驳回时建议填写）",
            "example": "未收到对应转账"
          }
        }
      },
      "DeductDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "portal_user_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "门户用户 UUID（即 JWT 的 sub）",
            "example": "018f3a2b-7c1d-7xxx-9e21-3f9a2b8c1d00"
          },
          "product_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本产品代码。**可选**：不传则按 X-Internal-Key 的归属推定；传了必须与密钥归属一致，否则 1004",
            "enum": [
              "storage",
              "phone",
              "desktop"
            ],
            "example": "storage"
          },
          "bill_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本产品账单号，≤64 位、产品内全局唯一；**先落库再调用**",
            "example": "storage-20261005-000123"
          },
          "amount_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "扣费金额，单位：分，必须 > 0",
            "example": 3000,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "detail": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "账单明细，原样写入流水供用户查看",
            "example": {
              "plan": "续费·标准版",
              "period": "30天",
              "instance_id": "st-0001"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "portal_user_id",
          "bill_no",
          "amount_cents"
        ]
      },
      "RefundDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "bill_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "原扣费账单号（必须已入账）",
            "example": "storage-20261005-000123"
          },
          "refund_bill_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "本次退款单号，幂等键；**先落库再调用**",
            "example": "refund:50001:1759200000"
          },
          "amount_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "退款金额，单位：分；累计退款不得超过原单金额",
            "example": 1000,
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "退款原因，展示给用户",
            "example": "开通失败自动退款"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "bill_no",
          "refund_bill_no",
          "amount_cents"
        ]
      },
      "OrderItemInputDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "product_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "产品代码",
            "enum": [
              "storage",
              "phone",
              "desktop"
            ],
            "example": "storage"
          },
          "sku_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "产品内 SKU ID",
            "example": "storage-500g"
          },
          "quantity": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "数量，默认 1；单项最多 10，**云手机（phone）最多 3**",
            "example": 1,
            "minimum": 1
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "product_code",
          "sku_id"
        ]
      },
      "CreateOrderDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "description": "订单项，1~10 项。**不要传价格**（后端按当前缓存价重算）",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrderItemInputDto"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items"
        ]
      },
      "RunReconciliationDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "biz_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "业务日（UTC），格式 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-10-08"
          },
          "product_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "产品代码",
            "example": "storage"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "biz_date",
          "product_code"
        ]
      },
      "ReportBillItemDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "bill_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "产品侧账单号",
            "example": "storage-20261008-000123"
          },
          "amount_cents": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "账单金额，单位：分",
            "example": 3000
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "账单类型：1 充值 2 扣费 3 退款",
            "enum": [
              1,
              2,
              3
            ],
            "default": 2
          },
          "portal_user_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "门户用户 UUID（可选）"
          },
          "related_bill_no": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "退款时指向的原单号"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "bill_no",
          "amount_cents"
        ]
      },
      "ReportBillsDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "biz_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "业务日（UTC），格式 YYYY-MM-DD",
            "example": "2026-10-08"
          },
          "product_code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "产品代码",
            "example": "storage"
          },
          "bills": {
            "description": "账单明细",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReportBillItemDto"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "biz_date",
          "product_code",
          "bills"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
